[Music]  Beyonce opening up like never before  about her life body and heritage Queen B  looks like royalty rocking a flower  crown on one of her two covers for Vogue  September issue which proudly proclaims  everyone's voice counts inside the  singer who reportedly had full creative  control over the cover her fourth with  the mag gets personal about her life as  a superstar mom it's no secret that the  flawless singer seemingly had the best  snapback ever after giving birth to her  first child blue ivy but she says quote  I put pressure on myself to lose all the  baby weight in three months and  scheduled a small tour to assure I would  do it looking back that was crazy after  weighing in at 218 pounds while pregnant  with twins sir and roomie  Beyonce admits she now feels more  beautiful sexy and interesting embracing  her natural body this makes me feel  strong and this makes me feel so lucky  to be a woman quote to this day my arms  shoulders breasts and thighs are fuller  I have a little mommy pouch and I'm in  no rush to get rid of it she also dished  on the birth complications she faced  with the Carter twins revealing she  developed toxemia and was on bed rest  for over a month  quote my health and my baby's health  were in danger so I had an emergency  c-section we spent many weeks in the  NICU as for her legacy the mother of  three wants to help create a more  inclusive culture for her kids for her  daughter's quote it's important to me  that they see themselves too in books  films and on runways and her hope for  her only son is to create better  representations for him so he is allowed  to reach his full potential as a man  [Music]  [Applause]

